5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I'm not really sure what to say first.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,Let's observe each other carefully. It's too early to make accusations.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,Indeed. Let's keep it civil while we wait for the Seer to find something useful.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not just going to sit around! If any of you are wolves, I'll find you!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,Let's remain calm. We should analyze the patterns of speech before jumping to conclusions.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
