31,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I think... Ryuji might be the werewolf.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, that's a very sudden accusation. What is your reasoning?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"A blind guess, most likely. How quaint.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Daisuke, don't just guess! We need a real plan if we're going to win this!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, your accusation lacks any logical basis. I have simply been observing.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm the Seer. I checked Ryuji last night.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"If you are the Seer, then Ryuji is the werewolf. That's a heavy claim.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"A Seer revealing themselves so early? How reckless. Or perhaps, how deceptive.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"What?! If Daisuke is the Seer, then we just found the wolf! Let's get him!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,A common tactic for the werewolf or possessed is to fake being the Seer to frame others.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm not lying... please believe me.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, your defense is logically sound, but @Daisuke's claim is direct. I'm torn.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I find it far more likely that Daisuke is playing a clumsy game of deception.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't like this! @Ryuji, if you're human, prove it! Otherwise, I'm voting for you!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"I cannot ""prove"" my role other than by my consistency. Daisuke's claim is too convenient.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm sorry for causing trouble, but it's true.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will trust the Seer's claim for now. It's the most direct lead we have.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"If you all wish to follow a whim, be my guest. I'll vote based on the most likely lie.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm with Victoria! Let's take out the wolf and end this!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,It seems the majority is swayed by a simple lie. A regrettable lack of critical thinking.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
